# Twinblade Blessing: "Enchanted creature has double strike" whoever controls the creature (CR 303.4e). Bot2's Memnite (1/1) attacks
# on turn 4 and Bot1 flashes the Aura onto it with Black Lotus' mana (kept untapped since turn 1): it deals 1 in the first-strike
# damage step and 1 more in the regular one, so Bot1 goes 20 -> 18, where unenchanted it would take 1. The Aura stays under Bot1's
# control on Bot2's creature.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Twinblade Blessing
Island x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T4 Bot2.DeclareAttackers]
Bot2.Attack(Memnite > Bot1)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Hand.Twinblade Blessing.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite.Keywords = DoubleStrike
[T4 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 18
Bot2.Life = 20
Bot1.Battlefield.Twinblade Blessing.AttachedTo = Memnite
